# Optional. Cortex works without any API key (it uses Yahoo Finance via yfinance).
# Finnhub is only used as a fallback when Yahoo returns nothing for a symbol.
# Get a free key at https://finnhub.io and set it as an environment variable.
# Cortex reads FINNHUB_API_KEY from the environment; it does NOT load this file automatically.
# Never commit a real key.
FINNHUB_API_KEY=
